# Copy into HERMES_BUILD_WORKSPACE as `.env.build-test` (never commit secrets).
# Pi `.env.local` must NOT be rsync'd by verify-from-pi.sh.
#
# WARNING: verify-from-pi.sh loads this before vitest / next build.
# Do NOT set NODE_ENV=production here — it breaks the test suite.
#
# CRITICAL — placeholder Supabase hosts:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL is inlined into Edge middleware at `next build` time.
#   If example.supabase.co is baked into `.next` and that artifact is rsynced to Pi,
#   admin pages return Internal Server Error (getaddrinfo ENOTFOUND).
#
#   verify-from-pi.sh SKIPS exporting keys whose values contain example.supabase.*
#   or *-placeholder, so they cannot override a real workspace `.env.local`.
#
#   Never rsync a verify-only `.next` to Pi. Use:
#     ./scripts/deploy-internal-next-from-wsl.sh
#   or on-Pi `npm run build` with the real `.env.local`.

# Optional non-Supabase compile helpers only. Prefer a real `.env.local` on the
# WSL workspace when you need a deployable Next build.
#
# DO NOT uncomment these for any build that might be copied to Pi:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://example.supabase.co
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=public-anon-placeholder
# SUPABASE_URL=https://example.supabase.co
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=service-role-placeholder
